        "_id": "69eb592776b95068720c2933",
        "title": "\ud83d\udd10 Open Results Page access \u2014 Authentication Required",
        "description": "<p>As part of our continued efforts to strengthen platform security, the Open Results page now requires student authentication.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>\ud83d\udcdd <strong>What's Changed</strong></h3><p>The Open Results page is no longer accessible to unauthenticated users. When students open the existing Open Results link, they will now be prompted to log in with their student credentials before viewing their results.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>\ud83c\udf93 <strong>How Students Can Access Results</strong></h3><p>Students can check their results through any of the following authenticated channels:</p><ul><li>\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Open Results Page</strong> \u2014 Now requires login with student credentials</li><li>\ud83d\udcbb <strong>Student Web Portal</strong> \u2014 Log in to view results</li><li>\ud83d\udcf1 <strong>Student Mobile App</strong> \u2014 Access results directly from the CampX Student App</li></ul><h3><br></h3><h3>\ud83c\udfeb<strong> For Administrators</strong></h3><ul><li>\ud83d\udcc2 <strong>Sidebar Access</strong> \u2014 The Open Results page is now available to administrators (Academic Coordinator / Department Workspace / Examination Workspace) as a dedicated sidebar tab item enabling quick access without relying on the public link.</li></ul><h3><br></h3><h3>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb <strong>For Faculty &amp; Classroom Coordinators</strong></h3><ul><li>\ud83d\udcca <strong>Student Profile \u2192 Academic Performance</strong> \u2014 Faculty and Classroom Coordinators can view individual student grades by navigating to the respective Student Profile and accessing the <strong>Academic Performance</strong> section. No separate access to the Open Results page is required.</li></ul><h3><br></h3><h3>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Why This Change</strong></h3><p>This update adds an additional layer of security to protect student academic records, ensuring that result data is accessible only to verified, authorized users. This aligns with data privacy best practices and safeguards against unauthorized access to sensitive student information.</p><h3><br></h3><h3>\u2705 <strong>Action Required</strong></h3><p>No action is required from institution administrators. Students using the existing Open Results link will simply be prompted to authenticate before accessing their results \u2014 no change in URL or process beyond the login step.</p>",
