        "_id": "69dbb639f16543592ed965d6",
        "title": "\ud83c\udfab Campus Helpdesk for Staff and Students \u2014 Now Live",
        "description": "<p>A centralized ticket management system for your campus. Students and faculty can raise support requests directly from their workspace, and institutions can configure teams, priorities, and agent assignments to ensure every issue reaches the right person.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83c\udf93 <strong>For Students &amp; Faculty:</strong> Raise a ticket by navigating to Campus Helpdesk from the top-left dropdown. Select a category, describe your issue, set priority, and submit. Track status and communicate with the support team \u2014 all in one place.</p>",
