        "title": "Celebrating health, awareness, and responsibility on the occasion of World Kidney Day 2026 at Malla Reddy University \ud83d\udc99",
        "description": "<p>The School of Allied &amp; Healthcare Sciences organized an insightful session highlighting the importance of kidney health, early detection, and preventive care. From expert talks to active student participation, the event empowered young minds to understand the value of a healthy lifestyle and regular check-ups.</p><p><br></p><p>Together, let\u2019s raise awareness and take a step towards a healthier future \u2014 because healthy kidneys mean a healthier life.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83c\udf3f \u201cKidney Health for All \u2013 Act Early, Protect Your Health\u201d</p>",
