        "title": "\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\udca1 Innovation in Action at Yantra Yugam!",
        "description": "<p>The \u201cYantra Yugam | 24-Hour National Level Hackathon \u2013 Validation Session\u201d at Malla Reddy University marked a crucial milestone where ideas transformed into impactful solutions.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udcbb Teams presented their prototypes, validated concepts, and received expert feedback to refine their innovations. From problem-solving to product thinking, participants showcased exceptional creativity, technical skills, and entrepreneurial mindset.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83c\udfaf The session focused on evaluating feasibility, scalability, and real-world impact \u2014 empowering students to take their ideas closer to implementation.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83d\udd25 A platform where innovation meets validation, and ideas evolve into reality!</p>",
        "targetAudienceType": "institution",
