        "title": "\ud83c\udf0d\u2728 Spreading Awareness, Inspiring Change!",
        "description": "<p><br></p><p>On the occasion of <strong>World Tuberculosis Day 2026</strong>, the School of Allied &amp; Healthcare Sciences at Malla Reddy University organized a meaningful <strong>\u201cTB Awareness Walkathon\u201d</strong> to educate, engage, and empower communities in the fight against tuberculosis.</p><p>\ud83e\ude7a With active participation from students, faculty, and healthcare professionals, the event highlighted the importance of early detection, prevention, and collective responsibility in eliminating TB.</p><p>\ud83c\udfa4 Inspiring talks, enthusiastic participation, and impactful awareness initiatives made the event a true reflection of commitment towards a healthier society.</p><p>\ud83d\udc99 Together, we move one step closer to a TB-free world</p>",
        "targetAudienceType": "institution",
