        "title": "\u2699\ufe0f\ud83d\ude80 Yantra Yugam | 24-Hour National Level Hackathon \u2013 Inauguration \ud83d\ude80\u2699\ufe0f",
        "description": "<p>Innovation takes center stage as Yantra Yugam, the 24-hour National Level Hackathon, was successfully inaugurated at Malla Reddy University.</p><p><br></p><p>Bringing together brilliant minds from across the country, the hackathon marks the beginning of an intense journey of ideation, coding, and problem-solving. Participants are set to push boundaries, collaborate, and transform ideas into impactful solutions within 24 hours.</p><p><br></p><p>\ud83d\udca1 Think. Build. Innovate.</p><p>\u26a1 24 Hours of Non-Stop Creativity</p><p>\ud83d\ude80 Shaping the Future Through Technology</p><p><br></p><p>The journey has begun \u2014 let the innovation unfold!</p>",
